# The vectors a reader fails when this rule is deleted, and no others:
# a string read refuses an encoded surrogate code point.
#
# CMakeLists.txt builds that reader, and ctest requires its failures to be
# exactly this list. A vector added to the corpus that pins the rule belongs here.

string-refuse-surrogate-encoded-in-utf8
string-refuse-low-surrogate-encoded-in-utf8
